{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1433090-blood-rousing-while-in-frenzy-v5}","id":1433090,"title":"Blood Rousing While In Frenzy [V5}","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-22T13:00:36-08:00","id":1433090,"title":"Blood Rousing While In Frenzy [V5}","content":"Since hunger can't go higher than 5 does that mean a vampire in hunger frenzy doesn't need to rouse the blood to use their physical disciplines?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T14:46:45-08:00","id":1433102,"title":"","content":"You can't intentionally rouse the blood when at hunger 5, the only exception is if an outside factor forces a rouse check (211).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26282-lacheur","name":"Lacheur","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T15:33:16-08:00","id":1433110,"title":"","content":"You can Hunger Frenzy for reasons other than being at Hunger 5. Being at Hunger 4 and smelling/tasting blood will do it for example. Or you might have used the 5-dot Golconda Loresheet ability and you could be at any Hunger and still Frenzying. But if you're talking about being at Hunger 5 and Frenzying as a result, then you will be unable to use any ability that requires a Rouse check because you cannot Rouse at Hunger 5. You are effectively out of blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25972-illithidactivity","name":"IllithidActivity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T15:46:53-08:00","id":1433113,"title":"","content":"OK.<br /> So a frenzying vampire cannot activate toughness or prowess then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T16:50:32-08:00","id":1433117,"title":"","content":"It's not about Frenzy, it's about Hunger. If you are at Hunger 5 then you cannot activate any powers that require a Rouse check. If you're Frenzying then you can still use physical Disciplines, but not if you're at Hunger 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25972-illithidactivity","name":"IllithidActivity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-22T18:05:52-08:00","id":1433125,"title":"","content":"Okie dokie, thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}